{
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "蚂蚁国际：Alipay+连上巴西Pix，游客可以扫码付款",
  "title_en": "Ant International: Alipay+ links up with Brazil's Pix, so travelers can pay by scanning codes",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "Pix是巴西的即时支付系统，由巴西中央银行开发和运营。在巴西，很多商店和餐厅都用Pix的二维码收钱。根据巴西央行2025年的报告，使用Pix的本地商户超过2220万家。",
      "en": "Pix is Brazil's instant payment system. It was developed by Brazil's central bank, which also runs it. In Brazil, many shops and restaurants use Pix QR codes to receive money. According to a 2025 report by Brazil's central bank, more than 22.2 million local merchants use Pix."
    },
    {
      "zh": "11月19日，蚂蚁国际宣布，它的跨境支付服务Alipay+已经和Pix连在一起了。现在，去巴西的游客可以用自己手机上的钱包，直接扫Pix二维码付款。",
      "en": "On November 19, Ant International announced that its cross-border payment service Alipay+ has been linked with Pix. Now, travelers going to Brazil can use the wallet on their own phone to scan a Pix QR code and pay directly."
    },
    {
      "zh": "能这样付款的钱包和手机银行App一共有50多个，支付宝也在其中。游客在商店、餐厅和景点等地方都可以这样用。",
      "en": "More than 50 wallets and mobile banking apps can pay this way, and Alipay is one of them. Travelers can use them like this in shops, restaurants, tourist sites and other places."
    },
    {
      "zh": "目前，Alipay+连接了超过1.5亿家商户和21亿个消费者账户，还和亚洲、中东和拉丁美洲的16个国家级二维码支付网络有合作。在拉丁美洲，蚂蚁国际也在阿根廷、智利和墨西哥做了类似的合作。",
      "en": "At present, Alipay+ connects more than 150 million merchants and 2.1 billion consumer accounts. It also works with 16 national QR code payment networks in Asia, the Middle East and Latin America. In Latin America, Ant International has also set up similar partnerships in Argentina, Chile and Mexico."
    }
  ],
